sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant WASM as Blazor WASM
    participant SSR as Blazor SSR
    participant API as Minimal API
    participant CV as Computer Vision
    participant OAI as OpenAI GPT-4.1
    participant GEM as Gemini Imagen3
    participant TS as Table Storage
    participant BS as Blob Storage
    participant SR as SignalR

    Note over U,SR: ═══ Auth Flow ═══
    U->>SSR: /dev-login?email=user@test.com
    SSR-->>U: 302 → / (Set-Cookie)
    U->>SSR: GET / (authenticated)

    Note over U,SR: ═══ Image Analysis Flow ═══
    U->>WASM: Upload Image (base64)
    WASM->>API: POST /api/images/analyze<br/>ImageData + Mode
    API->>API: Rate Limit Check (10/min)
    API->>API: Magic-byte Validation
    API->>CV: AnalyzeAsync(imageBytes)
    CV-->>API: (description, tags, confidence)
    alt Mode = ImageRegeneration
        API->>OAI: EnhanceDescriptionAsync(desc, tags)
        OAI-->>API: (enhanced, tokens)
        API->>GEM: GenerateAsync(enhanced)
        GEM-->>API: (imgData, imgType)
    else Mode = MemeGeneration
        API->>OAI: GenerateMemeCaptionAsync(tags)
        OAI-->>API: (top, bottom, tokens)
        API->>API: SkiaSharp Overlay
    end
    API-->>WASM: ImageAnalysisResponse (base64)
    WASM-->>U: Display Result

    Note over U,SR: ═══ Gallery Persist Flow ═══
    U->>WASM: Save to Gallery
    WASM->>API: POST /api/user-images
    API->>BS: Upload Blob
    API->>TS: Insert UserImage Entity
    TS-->>API: OK
    API-->>WASM: 201 Created

    Note over U,SR: ═══ Bulk Generate Flow ═══
    U->>WASM: Bulk Generate (10 prompts)
    WASM->>API: POST /api/bulk-generate/describe
    API->>OAI: DescribePersonAsync
    OAI-->>API: description
    API-->>WASM: BulkDescribeResponse
    loop 10× Parallel Variations
        WASM->>API: POST /api/bulk-generate/variation
        API->>GEM: GenerateImageAsync(prompt, image)
        GEM-->>API: (imgData, imgType)
        API-->>WASM: BulkVariationResponse
        WASM->>SR: Update Slot State
        SR-->>U: Live Progress Update
    end

    Note over U,SR: ═══ SignalR Sync ═══
    SSR->>SR: Circuit Established
    SR->>WASM: State Sync
    WASM->>U: Reactive UI Update